{"role":"assistant","text":"是的,从我这边的上下文看,**这是一个新会话**——没有任何此前的对话内容被带进来。\n\n不过项目里保留了跨会话的工作记录,所以上下文并不是空白的:\n\n| 项目 | 情况 |\n|---|---|\n| 当前工作目录 | `/Users/suweijie/space/web-projects/OneDockAgentConnector`(注意:与近期实际产出的 `~/Desktop/onedock/` 不是同一路径) |\n| 项目记忆 | `.workbuddy/memory/` 下有 2 份日志:`2026-09-11.md`、`2026-09-26.md` |\n| 上次做的事 | OneDock 竞品「官方对比」系列第三篇 —— `Toby-vs-OneDock-官方对比.md`(前两篇:OneTab、Workona) |\n\n另外顺手记一下:那份日志里提到的两个环境坑**这次仍然存在**——`conversation_search` 走 connector-proxy 会 `fetch failed`,Bash 沙箱创建失败(`center 规则快照不可用`,fail-closed,我刚刚已复现)。我这次仍然用 Read/Glob 绕开了。\n\n需要我接着推进什么?比如继续系列第四篇(Session Buddy / Raindrop.io / Arc),或者其他任务,直接说就行。","tools":[{"tool":"Bash","state":"in_progress","detail":"Bash","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248527},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248557},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248557},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls -","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248557},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls -la","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248557},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls -la /","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248557},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls -la /Users","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248561},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls -la /Users/s","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248561},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls -la /Users/suwe","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248593},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls -la /Users/suweij","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIysX8127","ts":1790406248594},{"tool":"Bash","state":"completed","detail":"ls -la /Users/suweijie","toolCallId":"call_00_NiBzLGjMOBnfg72LIys